# Cloudflare Pages reads this file from the root of the build output directory.
# scripts/build.mjs copies everything in public/ to that root on every build, so
# edit it here — a file dropped straight into output/ is deleted by the next run.
#
# The Content-Security-Policy is the part that has to be read before it is
# changed. This page is one HTML document with an inline script, an inline
# module map and style attributes throughout, and dc-runtime evaluates the
# component with `new Function`. That is why 'unsafe-inline' and 'unsafe-eval'
# are there: a policy without them renders a blank page. What the policy is
# actually buying is the other four directives — no script may come from any
# host but ours, and connect-src/img-src are pinned to the short list of places
# the page is allowed to reach after the visitor asks it to. That list is the
# same promise the status line makes, enforced by the browser instead of by
# code review.
#
# Cloudflare Web Analytics is deliberately allowed: the beacon is injected at
# the edge from static.cloudflareinsights.com and reports page counts to
# cloudflareinsights.com. Cloudflare already terminates every request to this
# site as its CDN, so the beacon adds no new recipient — but it is still a
# third-party request and a page-view tracker, which is why the status line
# says "cf analytics" rather than "no trackers".
#
# Hosts, all of them behind a click except the first-party ones:
#   ipapi.co, ipwho.is          ~/visitor, the whois button
#   tile.openstreetmap.org      the map, drawn only after that button
#   github.com                  systemctl in the shell
#   mozolewski.eu, rysinder.*   the self-directed HEAD probes
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'unsafe-eval' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://tile.openstreetmap.org; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com https://ipapi.co https://ipwho.is https://github.com https://mozolewski.eu https://rysinder.mozolewski.eu

# Cloudflare Pages serves every asset `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate` by
# default, which means a returning visitor revalidates all nine of them to be
# told nothing changed — and, measured on production, that even a *single* page
# load re-requests page.css and fonts.css three times and the two react files
# twice, because a must-revalidate response cannot be reused from the preload
# cache. Those duplicate requests are also what produced four "preloaded but not
# used" warnings in the console on production and none locally.
#
# The directories below are content that does not change in place: the vendor
# bundles are never edited, and a new portrait or font subset arrives under a new
# name. **If you ever overwrite one of these files without renaming it, a
# returning visitor keeps the old one for a year.**
#
# The stylesheets are hand-edited and keep their names, so they used to get five
# minutes instead. That was the wrong trade. index.html is uncached, so for those
# five minutes after a deploy a visitor ran new markup against the previous
# stylesheet — which is not "slightly out of date", it is broken whenever a
# change has a half in each file, and one shipped that way. scripts/build.mjs
# stamps every stylesheet URL with a hash of the file it points at now, so a
# changed stylesheet is a different URL and the two can never disagree; it
# refuses to build if a .css under assets/ has no stamp. That makes a year
# correct here, and it also spares a returning visitor the revalidation.
#
# index.html itself is untouched here and stays uncached, so a deploy is always
# visible immediately.
/assets/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/img/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
